# Copy to .env and fill in, or pass the file to `harness stdio-session -env`.
# .env is gitignored.
#
# This binary hosts one coding session for a parent process. Its credentials
# are the parent's to supply, in the environment it spawns the process with;
# a file is the fallback for driving the process by hand. Neither key is
# required and neither implies the other — supply the one whose models you
# intend to run.

# Google's key, for the Gemini models and for the vision tools. GOOGLE_API_KEY
# is accepted under that name too, because that is what Google's own SDKs read.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# DeepSeek's key, for deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp. Key from
# https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys — prepaid, needs balance.
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
